<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40184" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quinquennis</span></b> , e, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of five years</i> or <i>five years old</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">filia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. prol. 85</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olympias,</span>”
				<i>celebrated every fifth year</i>,
					<i>quinquennial</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. P.
					4, 6, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 8, 47</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oleae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 2, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juvenis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 3, 6</span></i>
			. —<i>Plur.</i> as <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quinquennĭa</span></b> , ōrum,
				n., for <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quinquennālĭa</span></b> , ium,
				<i>games celebrated every fifth year</i>, <i><span class="en">Stat. S.
				5, 3, 113</span></i>.</div>
